  33:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_uart.c ****         (++) Enable the USARTx interface clock.
  34:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_uart.c ****         (++) UART pins configuration:
  35:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_uart.c ****             (+++) Enable the clock for the UART GPIOs.
  36:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_uart.c ****             (+++) Configure these UART pins as alternate function pull-up.
  37:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_uart.c ****         (++) NVIC configuration if you need to use interrupt process (HAL_UART_Transmit_IT()
  38:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_uart.c ****              and HAL_UART_Receive_IT() APIs):
