  47:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_uart.c ****              and HAL_UART_Receive_DMA() APIs):
  48:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_uart.c ****             (+++) Declare a DMA handle structure for the Tx/Rx channel.
  49:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_uart.c ****             (+++) Enable the DMAx interface clock.
  50:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_uart.c ****             (+++) Configure the declared DMA handle structure with the required Tx/Rx parameters.
